Checkpoint commit: protects in-flight round-29 work after a background agent
reset the working tree to upstream main mid-round (recovered via reflog —
branch nemesis/study-v1 was intact; only uncommitted edits were lost and are
redone here). Remaining round-29 pieces (thinking phrases, graph controls,
study mindmaps+tests) land on top before the round commit.
