Subject: [PATCH 2/6] =?UTF-8?q?wip(nemesis):=20round-29=20checkpoint=202?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20=E2=80=94=20updater=20neutered=20(student=20build),=20live?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20thinking=20phrases,=20graph=20rotation/names/glow=20controls?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- About page (student): git-pull self-updater UNREACHABLE — replaced with
  'updates ship with Nemesis releases' (the updater tracks upstream Hermes
  main and rebuilds stock over the Nemesis fork; it reset this repo twice
  today). updates.json pinned to nemesis/study-v1 as a belt.
- Thinking preview: live one-line activity phrases (activity-phrase.ts,
  22 tests) with cross-fade, student-gated.
- Graph controls: rotationSpeed slider (0–3), showNames + neighborGlow
  toggles, live-apply without reheat jiggle.
---
