The state model + its first view. Nemesis now opens to a briefing of the
student's actual day instead of a blank chat box — the shift from toolset to OS.

- Academic Object Graph (src/lib/academic-graph.ts): file-backed model at
  ~/Documents/Nemesis Library/.nemesis/graph.json — courses, deadlines, exams,
  lectures, concepts, professors, applications, contacts, meetings; every object
  carries a provenance tier (instructor-stated..ai-inference) + source +
  timestamps + relationships + history; a changes feed. Tolerant loader + pure
  queries (dueSoon/recentChanges/eventsOnDay/scoreNextAction/weakConcepts).
- Today command center (src/app/today, Codex): the new DEFAULT home for the
  student build. Greeting + free-time + item counts; an accented scored
  next-action ('Quiz 4 · exam in 3 days · mastery 54%' → Start); cards for
  changed-since-yesterday (with provenance tags), due soon, today's plan, inbox
  teaser; a trust stripe ('sent nothing · submitted nothing'). Reads the graph +
  calendar; refreshes on focus. Student build boots to /today.
- Seed graph.json with the real PHCY semester so it's alive on first open.
- nemesis-graph agent skill + SOUL line (kit-synced): the agent read-merge-writes
  the graph proactively when it reads Blackboard/Outlook/syllabi/lectures.
- Verified live: app opens on Today, shows the seeded semester + provenance.
